== (6) the uniform-residue heuristic ==
 sum over examined non-Gersonides shapes of words/(p |clock|) = 4.4631; actual primitive hits beyond Gersonides: 1 (the -17 cycle; its own term is 210/973 = 0.216)
 the no-descent refinement, sum of no-descent words/|clock| = 3.9020
 h(log_3 2) = 0.9499555272 (repo: 0.9499555272), 1 - h = 0.0500444728 = the codimension of the no-descent set (sibling dimension ladder, Thm 1a) = the decay exponent of the heuristic per halving
 heuristic tail over the three nearest-critical shapes for 23 <= A <= 60: 0.35834; largest terms [(0.06154, 27, 17), (0.03416, 38, 24), (0.02188, 46, 29), (0.02147, 30, 19)] (the convergents 65/41 and 84/53 of log_2 3 dominate)
